p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">A great free plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/itw3/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/db549a2853888ecf39f9c1da8a51f5fe0ca49606ad0865ac1d633ae39eefb026?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/db549a2853888ecf39f9c1da8a51f5fe0ca49606ad0865ac1d633ae39eefb026?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/itw3/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Nigel <small>(itw3)</small></a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 7 12, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Works perfectly, compliments to the chef!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">I liked it.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/inflatabledesigner/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a04c680b6508ab74fe1715e751e88993b2cf7b0e808c6cbd084fca5b9429f914?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a04c680b6508ab74fe1715e751e88993b2cf7b0e808c6cbd084fca5b9429f914?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/inflatabledesigner/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">inflatabledesigner</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 7 10, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It delivers on its promise, I liked it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Helpfull</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/jeneu70/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/79920ca39d0ceba7a09523f5c242499c11553bb256db293a5817fd0e141fe246?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/79920ca39d0ceba7a09523f5c242499c11553bb256db293a5817fd0e141fe246?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/jeneu70/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">jeneu70</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 7 9, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Appreciate the option to use own HTML</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Almost there...</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/321numeralxyz/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3baeea7b495fb504041126b67b8939847d5c79dc97a46d3378e4748b7dd6035f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3baeea7b495fb504041126b67b8939847d5c79dc97a46d3378e4748b7dd6035f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/321numeralxyz/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">321numeralxyz</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 6 23, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I was very excited to put a conversational bot on the Coming Soon page to gather market data about what prospects need. I spent a while setting it up, asked ChatGPT for help when it didn\'t work, wasn\'t able to get effective tech support from LightStart immediately when that didn\'t work, and gave up. It\'s the kind of not-high-priority project where waiting for an email customer support reply isn\'t worth the time and effort of returning to the project later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A minor observation that is easily correctable: Every time I want to edit the Coming Soon page content -- i.e. what the visitor sees -- I have to search for where to do it. The tiny \"edit page\" is visually lost in the Design tab\'s display of template options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Trojan horse to install other plugins</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sourixx/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d5773c169212df6b0a3a2a9cb1497b4df394cea778ccf55e6fe988ed1f3c5798?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d5773c169212df6b0a3a2a9cb1497b4df394cea778ccf55e6fe988ed1f3c5798?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sourixx/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">sourixx</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 6 16, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This plugin is just a Trojan horse designed to force you to install other plugins — I’m out!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Lightweight and easy to use!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/phoenixflower/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c63061621efd4dba860706039808fc8319d5a531c41f794d1e314ea12a77bbd0?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c63061621efd4dba860706039808fc8319d5a531c41f794d1e314ea12a77bbd0?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/phoenixflower/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">phoenixflower</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 5 12, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I value a plugin that is lightweight, straightforward and does what it says it does!  Thank you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:146:\"Easy Drag &amp; Drop Page Builder that adds a splash page to your site that it&#039;s perfect for a coming soon page, maintenance or landing page.\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:7:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:71:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=976658\";s:7:\"caption\";s:24:\"Maintenance Mode Example\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:71:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=976658\";s:7:\"caption\";s:27:\"Maintenance Mode Example #2\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=1834233\";s:7:\"caption\";s:11:\"Bot Example\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:71:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=976658\";s:7:\"caption\";s:26:\"Dashboard General Settings\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:71:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=976658\";s:7:\"caption\";s:25:\"Dashboard Design Settings\";}i:6;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:71:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=976658\";s:7:\"caption\";s:26:\"Dashboard Modules Settings\";}i:7;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-maintenance-mode/assets/screenshot-7.png?rev=1832142\";s:7:\"caption\";s:22:\"Dashboard Bot Settings\";}}s:8:\"versions\";a:79:{s:3:\"1.3\";s:66:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.3.zip\";s:5:\"1.5.3\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.5.3.zip\";s:6:\"1.6.10\";s:69:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.6.10.zip\";s:5:\"1.6.5\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.6.5.zip\";s:5:\"1.6.6\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.6.6.zip\";s:5:\"1.6.7\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.6.7.zip\";s:5:\"1.6.8\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.6.8.zip\";s:5:\"1.6.9\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/wp-maintenance-mode.1.6.9.zip\";s:5:\"1.7.0\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/p