class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/kernowmajor/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3e511ada33641e4e1d77be4bb4903857922b00e3fe31c01c36ca032e397a76a1?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3e511ada33641e4e1d77be4bb4903857922b00e3fe31c01c36ca032e397a76a1?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/kernowmajor/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">kernowmajor</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 9 9, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not long had the plugin installed but look great so far</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">El mejor de todos los que probe, optimole</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/victoredu/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/86c09853920e3dd53183f5ed279544ddd449548685e368428fd8b436c984a3ef?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/86c09853920e3dd53183f5ed279544ddd449548685e368428fd8b436c984a3ef?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/victoredu/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">victoredu</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 8 11, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Realmente cómodo, fácil y muy útil, optimiza realmente todo con total seguridad</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Best No.1 - No comparion with others.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/tppfpp739/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b1fd2628992537064d930edfd98ee2e917b286b6641fe73925f411215696b54e?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b1fd2628992537064d930edfd98ee2e917b286b6641fe73925f411215696b54e?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/tppfpp739/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">tppfpp739</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 8 9, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Optimole is the premier plugin provider, unmatched in scope. Their paid plans are robust. If the price were just a little bit lower it would be much more attractive to jump on right away.<br>I have compared their service against numerous alternatives; while others have significant issues, Optimole operates smoothly af.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I advise the development team that certain basic details are missing from the documentation. Providing more comprehensive information regarding minor errors would significantly improve the user experience. If the team lacks time to address these directly, they could establish a community platform where users share encountered issues and solutions. Such a repository could serve as feedback or be integrated into the official documentation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is merely a suggestion. Nevertheless, Optimole remains one of the best providers I have utilized. Even within the free tiers, no other service comes close. I extend my gratitude to Optimole for providing these services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Karya Anda sangat bermanfaat</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/arjantoab/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/008cd1ab479a0339b64c8cf318e26c2771bea3a925472f861b89d869c88d0dda?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/008cd1ab479a0339b64c8cf318e26c2771bea3a925472f861b89d869c88d0dda?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/arjantoab/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Arjanto AB <small>(arjantoab)</small></a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 7 26, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tingkatkan Pelayanan dengan kualitas yang optimal</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">GOOD</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/1homeplusone/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/37fbbd9732a08ee705eeb9c3266691997cfd9e5b3510f17e534a3b4455017f3d?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/37fbbd9732a08ee705eeb9c3266691997cfd9e5b3510f17e534a3b4455017f3d?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/1homeplusone/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">1homeplusone</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 7 9, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>good plugin</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">good for organising media</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/franxubcn/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d5d5c1d19c95cfefff4d88690b3a9a338a3fec91b8c40cdf1437e9133dd8de45?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d5d5c1d19c95cfefff4d88690b3a9a338a3fec91b8c40cdf1437e9133dd8de45?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/franxubcn/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">franxubcn</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 6 12, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Good plugin for organize your media</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Super PlugIn</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rockstroh/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e17025f023d831a17ca768e1ffc49d826b00330c6dded0b4603403d344678db5?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e17025f023d831a17ca768e1ffc49d826b00330c6dded0b4603403d344678db5?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rockstroh/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">rockstroh</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 5 20, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Macht deine Seite um einiges schneller.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">More Performance, Less Bloat!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/kinggrizzly/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/33101dbb7c4813c9b35a075a8c6423e8dd21bb90f486ec16621d693e9d4fc7ef?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/33101dbb7c4813c9b35a075a8c6423e8dd21bb90f486ec16621d693e9d4fc7ef?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/kinggrizzly/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">kinggrizzly</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 5 5, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When an image is uploaded to a WordPress site, it gets replicated a number of times at a variety of sizes on the server. Other image optimization plugins add to this bloat by creating even more versions of these files in different formats and sizes. So the uploads folder on a website becomes a total disaster.<br><br>We like to disable these behaviors with a snippet and install Optimole! It just needs the one \'Full\' image and can deliver a perfectly sized image in the best format possible for a visitor, all on the fly, all from the Optimole CDN! An excellent plugin with a great support team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">great plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/maxgaet/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f21c0350d2da3a243fe2b99f77ec7f0de2fcce40123b82433d2cdec0ae60f39a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f21c0350d2da3a243fe2b99f77ec7f0de2fcce40123b82433d2cdec0ae60f39a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/maxgaet/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">maxgaet</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 4 27, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>it actually help managing contents in my new website</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:156:\"Automatically optimize images with bulk compression, lazy loading, WebP/AVIF conversion &amp; CloudFront image CDN. Boost Core Web Vitals &amp; conversions.\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:7:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:18:\"Dashboard Overview\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:56:\"Get 20K extra free visits by enabling the Optimole badge\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:63:\"Compression Mode: Adjust for speed, quality, or custom settings\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:59:\"Resize Settings: Limit image size and enable smart cropping\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:65:\"Image Exclusions: Filters to skip optimization &amp; lazy loading\";}i:6;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:55:\"Image Protection: Add branded watermarks to your images\";}i:7;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/optimole-wp/assets/screenshot-7.png?rev=3415513\";s:7:\"caption\";s:43:\"Lazy Loading: Load images only when visib