n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Works really good</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/groso/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6da0f6ba979994ebf9419621891ddb735407e932c6ec0f0747f356ae43b4b1ae?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6da0f6ba979994ebf9419621891ddb735407e932c6ec0f0747f356ae43b4b1ae?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/groso/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">groso</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 4 24, 2023</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks for your work!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">It is perfect to me</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/memo88/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5868fe19a599d99eb384ed80d42be7d943c1f00c000c4559c0eb3ba82a84c105?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5868fe19a599d99eb384ed80d42be7d943c1f00c000c4559c0eb3ba82a84c105?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/memo88/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">memo88</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 4 1, 2023</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A solution that satisfies all needs is perfect and demanding for me! Thank you very much!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Added it for Neve theme</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/marywt/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a083fced75b1d4ff46704176f198b511ea8508ff7c5b5ba1d273181acaca9234?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a083fced75b1d4ff46704176f198b511ea8508ff7c5b5ba1d273181acaca9234?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/marywt/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">marywt</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 3 1, 2023</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Neve theme suggested I add this to extend the functionality but really it does little we didn\'t have except for the easy link to mystock images. We were able to remove a previous plugin because this did social icons too but of course that didn\'t reduce our total plugins. <br>It has worked smoothly since being installed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">I find no reason to fault this plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/unclej/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b64d351c2d57d2463497ea450dcf4067a4295e9da1fafeeebb96fb8d897345ba?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b64d351c2d57d2463497ea450dcf4067a4295e9da1fafeeebb96fb8d897345ba?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/unclej/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">uncleJ</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 1 18, 2023</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Other than the constant annoying message to rate the plugin, I find no reason to fault it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:139:\"Add modules: share buttons, header/footer scripts, disable comments, reading progress, custom fonts, custom login &amp; more in one plugin.\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:7:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3344395\";s:7:\"caption\";s:19:\"Orbit Fox Dashboard\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3344395\";s:7:\"caption\";s:16:\"Login Customizer\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3344395\";s:7:\"caption\";s:17:\"Website Templates\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3344395\";s:7:\"caption\";s:20:\"Reading Progress Bar\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3344395\";s:7:\"caption\";s:21:\"Social Sharing Module\";}i:6;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3345035\";s:7:\"caption\";s:13:\"Cookie Notice\";}i:7;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:72:\"https://ps.w.org/themeisle-companion/assets/screenshot-7.png?rev=3345035\";s:7:\"caption\";s:12:\"Custom Fonts\";}}s:8:\"versions\";a:153:{s:5:\"1.0.0\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/themeisle-companion.1.0.0.zip\";s:5:\"1.0.1\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/themeisle-companion.1.0.1.zip\";s:5:\"1.0.2\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/themeisle-companion.1.0.2.zip\";s:5:\"1.0.3\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/themeisle-companion.1.0.3.zip\";s:5:\"1.0.4\";s:68:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/them