bsites now. Fast, easy to setup and integrates with Cloudflare in minutes!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great Caching Plugin.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/spk100/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fe2bcb599e18fb792573fd7aa94bb10615b189cab86c848cb7d42d2f7ef790e2?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fe2bcb599e18fb792573fd7aa94bb10615b189cab86c848cb7d42d2f7ef790e2?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/spk100/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Praveen Kumar <small>(spk100)</small></a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 9 3, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I moved from another plugin to Super Page Cache recently. Support has been amazing, quick and fast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Set up is blazing fast. Activate, configure a few things and you are done.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Happy that I chose this :) </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great cache works smooth</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 trên 5 sao\" data-title-template=\"%s trên 5 sao\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Bởi <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sakshin/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f17c35037f53cfdda3156984c2c98482f78528cdc8c671578e7c2c479a1a52f3?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f17c35037f53cfdda3156984c2c98482f78528cdc8c671578e7c2c479a1a52f3?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sakshin/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Sakshin</a> vào <span class=\"review-date\">Tháng 8 31, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep on rocking</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:126:\"Boost PageSpeed, SEO, and Core Web Vitals with full page caching, JS/CSS optimization, media optimization, and Cloudflare CDN.\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:7:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:77:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-cloudflare-page-cache/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3335580\";s:7:\"caption\";s:27:\"Enable Caching in One Click\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:77:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-cloudflare-page-cache/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3335580\";s:7:\"caption\";s:34:\"Cache Management with Activity Log\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:77:\"https://ps.w.org/wp-cloudflare-page-cache/asse